sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser Team UI
    participant API as Add-on Admin API
    participant R as Team repository
    participant SSE as Revision stream

    B->>API: GET bootstrap
    API->>R: Read compact bootstrap state
    R-->>API: Current revision and resources
    API-->>B: Navigation, permissions, resource tokens
    B->>API: GET views/{active-view}
    API->>R: Build view-scoped projection
    API-->>B: View payload only
    B->>SSE: Open state/stream
    R-->>SSE: Revision changes
    SSE-->>B: Revision-only invalidation
    B->>API: Refresh invalidated active view
    API-->>B: New scoped payload

    Note over B,API: Mutations use expected revisions and resource tokens while broad state stays out of routine refreshes
